flowchart LR
    A[Query] --> B[Lexical: BM25 / inverted index]
    A --> C[Semantic: dense embeddings ANN]
    B --> D[Fuse scores: RRF / weighted]
    C --> D
    D --> E[Top-k candidates]
    E --> F[Rerank: cross-encoder]
    F --> G[Final ranked results]
    G --> H[Evaluate: recall@k, MRR, nDCG]
    H --> I{Recall too low?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Better chunks / embeddings / hybrid weights]
    J --> A
    I -- No --> K[Serve results]
